<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 3.0 bln SKR in 11-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 3.0 bln SKR in 11-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of 3.0 billion crowns of 11-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1030 GMT on September 18.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1037</p>
<p> Auction date			    Sept 18, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date			   Aug 15, 2007</p>
<p> Coupon (pct)			    8.00</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)   3.00</p>
<p> Settlement date			 Sept 23, 1996</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
